    "status": "present",
    "value": "Count splits into three nonempty contiguous subarrays whose sums are nondecreasing, modulo1000000007. The approach is: nonnegative prefix sums permit two monotone second-split boundaries. Its target cost is O(n) time/O(n) space. Treat the invariant underlying that approach as the reason each local update preserves the required result. Check it against an independent bounded reference before relying on large-domain constructions."
  },
